 and white sunglasses  up until that point shelton had mostly  tv credits on her resume  but after the sand lot her career really  took off the california blonde later  appeared in pleasantville and never been  kissed  and wasn't afraid to go grind house for  quentin tarantino in 2007's death proof  she appeared in the stylish sin city and  has worked with oliver stone twice  in 1995's nixon and 2008's w she also  popped up as jones bff on an episode of  mad men in 2013.  most recently she appeared alongside  dwayne the rock johnson in his 2018  video game adaptation rampage  veteran character actor art lefleur had  some pretty legendary cleats to fill  when he accepted the role of the babe in  the sandlot  luckily lefleur already had a couple of  baseball films under his belt  mr baseball and field of dreams making  him something of a sports film mvp  he's worked fairly consistently ever  since appearing in cult classics like  the blob  family fair like the santa claus 2 and  episodes of house and key and peel  by the time karen allen appeared as the  empathetic mom in the sandlot she had  already cemented her place in fans  hearts  as katie in 1978's classic frat comedy  animal house  and indiana jones gal pal marion  ravenwood in 1981's raiders of the lost  ark  indiana jones  always knew someday you'd come walking  back through my door  spunky and likeable allen made for an  affable sparring partner to bill murray  and scrooged  and turned on the waterworks and john  carpenter's sci-fi drama starman  opposite jeff bridges  after her son was born in 1990 allen  took smaller roles such as her work in  the sand lot so she could spend more  time with her family  in 1993 she and her son moved to  massachusetts into a converted barn  she'd purchased  she got involved in the local theater  scene acting in and directing plays at  the berkshire  theatre festival and teaching classes  steven spielberg managed to lure her  back for the fourth indie flick  indiana jones in 